  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Đặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là độ dài cạnh của tứ diện đều.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>△</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math> cân tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math>.</li></ul> \n\t\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math>, ta có  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mn>73</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mn>73</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mn>73</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/1dbed9fcbfae325d4faeef01a86a08305abcd9032d22ee34ecd18f5d9e029a8b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
